{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415810","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415810","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1041581001:1":{"text":"嘿，那位蛮血朋友！你手臂上的是护腕吗？你的拳套去哪了？","source_cn":"嘿，那位蛮血朋友！你手臂上的是护腕吗？你的拳套去哪了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD3AA6030198403FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041581002:1":{"text":"拳套？我没有拳套啊。","source_cn":"拳套？我没有拳套啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79440DE1A9941F2C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041581003:1":{"text":"至于手臂上的……你说的是这两块鳞甲吧？说是护腕应该也没什么问题。","source_cn":"至于手臂上的……你说的是这两块鳞甲吧？说是护腕应该也没...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9736896462976BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041581004:1":{"text":"噢！抱歉抱歉，我还以为你也和我一样，是个擅长用拳的摔角手呢。","source_cn":"噢！抱歉抱歉，我还以为你也和我一样，是个擅长用拳的摔角手呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x46A677E29C6E86BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041581005:1":{"text":"是吗？原来我看起来很像摔角手啊！","source_cn":"是吗？原来我看起来很像摔角手啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x32F90A5CA1119D21","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041581006:1":{"text":"可惜我的武技其实不算很出众。要不是有这身还算坚硬的鳞甲，恐怕我在沙漠里都存活不下来，更别提带领乌尔氏族走出困境了。","source_cn":"可惜我的武技其实不算很出众。要不是有这身还算坚硬的鳞甲...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x709823EDE6E1D790","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041581007:1":{"text":"如果你是在找摔角对手的话，可能要让你失望了，抱歉啦。","source_cn":"如果你是在找摔角对手的话，可能要让你失望了，抱歉啦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF0E79EFC37DCE043","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041581008:1":{"text":"不不不，不要这样说。","source_cn":"不不不，不要这样说。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6027097E86B7DA40","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041581009:1":{"text":"像你这么年轻又坚毅的孩子，还与生俱来这么出众的天赋，怎么能妄自菲薄呢！","source_cn":"像你这么年轻又坚毅的孩子，还与生俱来这么出众的天赋，怎...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE2E78C05208E5F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041581010:1":{"text":"我虽然没有去过沙漠，但也听说过生活在那种环境下有多艰苦。你已经证明了自己的力量！","source_cn":"我虽然没有去过沙漠，但也听说过生活在那种环境下有多艰苦...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9EFDBDF95240ACB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041581011:1":{"text":"“是金子总会发光”！你只是恰巧生在沙漠里，被漫天的沙子暂时遮住了光芒而已！","source_cn":"“是金子总会发光”！你只是恰巧生在沙漠里，被漫天的沙子...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B866B8F7BC304EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041581012:1":{"text":"咳咳……谢谢你的夸奖……很少有人这么夸奖我呢。","source_cn":"咳咳……谢谢你的夸奖……很少有人这么夸奖我呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8EBEF6D10958CEAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041581013:1":{"text":"也许你说得对，我该离开沙漠外出旅行一趟——呃，不过要先把乌尔氏族里的事都安排好才行。","source_cn":"也许你说得对，我该离开沙漠外出旅行一趟——呃，不过要先...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8587802C22D35134","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041581014:1":{"text":"到时候，我可以去绿裔的领地上看看！","source_cn":"到时候，我可以去绿裔的领地上看看！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB056A3D2D294065F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041581015:1":{"text":"哈哈，那就一言为定！我会去迎接你的！","source_cn":"哈哈，那就一言为定！我会去迎接你的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6D061B91B481DDE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041581016:1":{"text":"要是到时你发现了自己的摔角天赋，千万别忘了和我痛快地比试一场啊！","source_cn":"要是到时你发现了自己的摔角天赋，千万别忘了和我痛快地比...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC9728524CD14B7F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:坦布尔":{"text":"坦布尔","source":"坦布尔","status":"source"},"speaker:阿尔萨":{"text":"阿尔萨","source":"阿尔萨","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":17,"localized_text_count":16,"speaker_count":2}}